        "routeIndex": 61,
        "approach": "Use the Farringdon exit onto Cowcross Street. Follow Cowcross Street east to St John Street, then the public Charterhouse Street pavement towards Charterhouse Square. Follow the square’s western street edge past Malmaison to the Charterhouse frontage on the north side. Keep to the public street; do not enter the private Charterhouse Mews passage or university campus.",
        "viewpoint": "Stop clear of the north-side entrances, with the Charterhouse buildings in view. Start the tour here; the first story plays immediately.",
        "access": "Exterior story; no ticket or garden entry needed. This is a residential community. The garden and visitor rooms have separate hours and may close."
