        "approach": "Return along the western side of Charterhouse Square, then follow Charterhouse Street towards the meat-market halls.",
        "viewpoint": "Use the north pavement of Charterhouse Street, looking across towards the East/West Meat Market frontage near Grand Avenue. Stay clear of crossings and loading entrances.",
        "access": "The tour stays outside. Trading is principally overnight on weekdays. Follow current works signs; the proposed point is a desk candidate, not a claim about today’s barriers."
