        "approach": "From Smithfield take St John Street north, then St John’s Lane towards the Gate. Turn west into Briset Street just before the Gate, then north into Britton Street.",
        "viewpoint": "On the east pavement opposite number 25, look high below the cornice for five pale reliefs among the brick and stone. Trees may hide some; adjust along the same pavement without stepping into the road.",
        "access": "No entry required. The opposite pavement is narrow: keep doors and passing space clear."
      },
