        "approach": "Retrace Britton Street to Briset Street, turn east along Briset, then towards the Gate on St John’s Lane.",
        "viewpoint": "Stand to one side of the southern paved approach and look towards the arch. Keep its through-route and museum door clear.",
        "access": "Exterior story. Museum and guided rooms have separate hours. Use current signs if roof works affect the approach."
