        "routeIndex": 191,
        "approach": "Pass through the Gate, turn west through St John’s Square and St John’s Path to Britton Street, then north. Follow the south pavement of Clerkenwell Road west to the pedestrian signals beside Old Sessions House. Cross at those signals, then go around the Sessions House towards the Green.",
        "viewpoint": "From public space on the Green, face the white frontage and red door of the Marx Memorial Library at 37a. Stop clear of café tables and through-routes.",
        "access": "The 2024 layout differs from old imagery. Follow current paving and works signs; there is no need to enter the library."
