          "longitude": -0.10404
        },
        "routeIndex": 246,
        "approach": "Leave the Green by Clerkenwell Close. Follow the Close around the churchyard. At the Three Kings, follow Clerkenwell Close as it bends right, leaving the branch to the left. Turn right into Sans Walk. Follow Sans Walk to Woodbridge Street and turn right. At the Sekforde Street junction, continue down Woodbridge Street to the chapel.",
        "viewpoint": "Use a clear place on the opposite/northeast pavement. Look across for the brick chapel and white CLERKENWELL MEDICAL MISSION fascia.",
        "access": "Both pavements are narrow; keep doors and driveways clear. Current church use does not imply access to the former workroom."
      },
