        "approach": "Retrace Woodbridge Street northwest to Sekforde Street. Take Sekforde north to St John Street, then use the nearby pedestrian signals to reach the opposite/east pavement. Return a short distance south to see the frontage.",
        "viewpoint": "From the east pavement, look across and up towards the green and cream Ingersoll lettering at 223–227 St John Street. Stay clear of the Sekforde corner and the crossing landing.",
