        "approach": "From the Ingersoll view return north to the signals. Complete the crossings to Skinner Street’s north pavement, then follow Skinner west to Rosoman Street. Use the zebra crossing to cross Rosoman Street. On the far pavement, turn right for a few steps, then left into Exmouth Market.",
        "viewpoint": "Continue southwest along Exmouth to the church/Spafield Street area opposite the green-tiled Exmouth Arms. Stop on a clear pavement edge, away from entrances and deliveries. Space EC1 is number 25; GAIL’s is 33–35.",
